[node name="Portal" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "The finish portal IN MARBLE: model, glow and the win gate. scenes/ring/portal.tscn node for node -- the same Glow, the same Gate at the same transform in the same finish_gate group -- with assets/models/marble_portal.glb in place of the hell-rock one, because Map 2 is a white rotunda and Map 1's ragged brimstone arch read as a different game. The EFFECT SURFACE is unchanged: marble_portal_build paints portal_build's own swirl into marble's spare atlas cell and draws it through the same material (albedo + emissive, Closest, emission strength 1.0), so the portal looks the same from the inside out -- only its surround changed. Instanced into scenes/ring/marble.tscn at the finish bearing (345 deg)."

